> > - Each player can only play one game per tournament. If you die, you
> >   have to wait for the next one.
> 
> I don't really see the use of this. Especially since you explicitely allow  
> people to trade information (via YAAP and so on). I'm afraid this may lead  
> to people having several account just to play several time or similar  
> stuff.

I agree.

I suggest generating 100 seeds, and when a player starts a game he is 
given one he has not gotten yet, chosen at random.  A player is done for 
the month once he uses up all 100 seeds, but that shouldn't happen with 
anyone taking it seriously.

Cheating would still be possible, but it would require significant 
effort. 


